                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This is sad and outrageous. Jonathan Salant is a good man and a great reporter. New Jerseyans deserve objective coverage of how decisions in Washington affect our lives. Without it, all we have are partisans on social media and paid political ads. Please reconsider!",
