                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our hospitals, especially in rural counties like Warren, and community health centers, like those run by the wonderful @Zufall_Health, heavily depend on Medicaid funding. If Medicaid is cut 50%, some of them would not survive (and hospitals would charge all of us more).",
