                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "A final note -- there's almost no local press coverage of our Congressional delegation in NJ, beyond political horse race stuff. While I hope our remaining local press will report on this issue at least, it falls to every citizen to ask their reps how they plan to vote and why.",
