                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Actually, even this CBO letter, which the Republicans are touting, says that over 2 million eligible Americans would lose health coverage simply because of the increased frequency of having to fill out forms and other new burdensome bureaucratic requirements.",
