                "retweet_count": 56,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If only Trump and GOP members of Congress had to personally explain to parents of kids with brain cancer why they decided to stop their clinical trials, instead of leaving that terrible task to doctors and to hospitals.",
