                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "So there are two big questions here - will millions of Americans lose affordable health care today, and will our Constitution still mean something tomorrow?\n\nIgnore the political horse race coverage, and focus on what's really at stake.",
