                "quoted_status_profile_username": "JDVance",
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 20,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "No one denies hospitals give charity care at public expense to anyone who's sick or injured. If you want to change that and let those people die, propose a law.\n\nBut how is any of this an argument for ending Obamacare tax credits that go only to eligible middle class Americans?",
