                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I told CNN last night about a man I met this week whose health care premiums are going up by 1000% -- so high that he and his wife wondered if they should get a divorce so one of them could qualify for Medicaid.\n\nOpening the gov't while addressing this is the only sane solution. https://t.co/uvoVvgFSwI",
