                "text": "Yes, you can do this \ud83d\udc47 if you're the president's son and foreign countries are shoveling cash into your pocket for favors from your dad!\n\nBut maybe not if you're a middle class American whose health insurance premiums  just tripled because your dad doesn't care about them.",
